INSERT INTO `quest_offer_reward` (`ID`, `Emote1`, `Emote2`, `Emote3`, `Emote4`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `EmoteDelay4`, `RewardText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So, that is why you are here, you seek my wisdom, and my knowledge as your ancestors before you have, very well.', 0),
(40353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You have done it, I am impressed. You are worthy of my power, and I bestow upon you the energies that many of your ancestors have used.$B$BMay your travels be plentiful, there is a future ahead of you shaman.', 0),
(40402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Claws perfect, Tharg thanks new friend.', 0),
(40403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Pretty gift! Me still angry at Tharg but less angry now. Thanks new friend for bringing Bourok gift, marsh dangerous!$B$BDrink some grog, grog of friendship!', 0),
(40404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Tharg friend sent him meat? Tharg love meat! Tharg love old friend, new friend too.$B$BHere, Tharg had gift for new friend for help.$B$BTharg loves new friend.', 0),
(40405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Yes, yes. Good meat, enough too, me make us sausage.', 0),
(40406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Perfect mon.$B$BThis will make for great poison, Balai makes the poison and dips darts in it. Balai uses this small wooden thing to shoot darts at the enemy, with poison!$B$BSmall little things can kill you, the marsh teaches, think about the mosquitos. And here\'s your reward, it will help you one day.', 0),
(40407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The power coming from this sigil is quite strong, and will prove useful for study, thanks again for everything you have done $C, I will make sure it is put to good use in defense of the realm.', 0),
(40408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Why look at this here, you out done yourself, truly! I haven\'t seen some dang-nab spider legs this juicy in a few years now, they\'ve been getting extra fat down there!$B$BNow we can have a real good meal!', 0),
(40409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Well, I cannot thank you enough for what you\'ve done, with less murloc around it means I can do my job in peace without having to constantly watch the waterline.', 0),
(40410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah, this is it, and it\'s still sealed, I would have expected those dumb creatures to pry it open, or use the oil to make a big fire or something, it seems they couldn\'t figure it out, or hadn\'t gotten around to it yet.$B$BThanks again for the help, you may have saved my hide here!', 0),
(40411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Privateer Groy practically snatches it from your hands, a wide grin upon his face.>$B$BAhh, its been a while... a long while. I suppose you want something in return for running all that way. Here, some coin to cover the trip. If I ever need more I\'ll let you know, heh.', 0),
(40413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ahh, about time, I hate having to ferry to Theramore for a meal!', 0),
(40414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This may not be the end of the murloc threat, but this will no doubt slow them down. Thanks again, as promised.', 0),
(40415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Well, thanks for gathering these reports, its good to hear news from the frontier, even if some of it is bad, take this coin as thanks for the work.', 0),
(40416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Well, I must say, this is the last thing I had expected to come into my shop, I haven\'t heard from Wallace in some time, not seeing family certainly makes you miss old times.', 0),
(40417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So, you have delivered the letter then? How did he like it?$B$BWait, he sent this? Truly this could have fetched a noble\'s wage in gold, I must thank you for not being a brigand and making off with it, I shall use it with great honor.$B$BThanks again, for all you\'ve done. $N, take this coin for all the traveling you have done.', 0),
(40418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Now that those raptors have been culled we may be able to make more supply trips out in the swamp without worrying so much.$B$BI took it upon myself to gather a payment for you on behalf of Theramore, it may not be much, but all help should be rewarded.', 0),
(40548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I followed the footprints and I found our suspect. I couldn\'t do much more. I\'m just a scout.$B$BThat\'s why you are here.', 0),
(40549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You say that their chieftain had this tablet with drawings resembling the burned inn... curious. We will need someone able to read the quillboar scripture.', 0),
(40550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah yes, quillboar writing. Very hard to learn, very hard. I can read it, though. Did some business with them a long time ago. Nasty bunch, I tell you.$B$BHowever, you know how it is here. Everything has a price.', 0),
(40551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hah, good job. I hope you didn\'t have to dispose of too many Venture Co. workers... And I hope their insurance covers this!$B$B<Sputtervalve laughs.>$B$BLet\'s get to translating this thing.', 0),
(40552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So it wasn\'t them... Unless the quillboars are the masters of deception, we reached a dead end.', 0),
(40553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Damn it. If it was the quillboars, it would make it so easy. Shame, but at least we ruled out one of the suspects.$B$BNevertheless, good work. Finally we got at least a step closer to solving this mystery. Please, take this gold as a reward from lady Jaina herself.', 0),
(40554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So this is all we have. Well, it is a lead as good as any other. But what can we do with this information?', 0),
(40555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'In the grave, you find skeletal remains of a tauren. He must\'ve died at least a few years ago.$B$BThe grave, however, has been recently dug up and hastily buried with earth. The dirt is still loose, it must\'ve been no longer than a few weeks.$B$BSome equipment is buried with the tauren too. Leather straps, metal coins and pauldrons, and a beautiful, one handed axe.', 0),
(40556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'A dug-up grave of a tauren warrior... Another mystery, another question.$B$BLet me gather my thoughts on this.$B$BSo, $N, you say that he died a long time ago. It is no coincidence. The shield must\'ve been taken from his grave. But... why?$B$BWhy would anyone do this? This doesn\'t make any sense. If someone wanted us to blame the Horde, they could\'ve found a better way to do it for sure...', 0),
(40557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I suspect they might know something...', 0),
(40558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You met with the Horde unauthorized? This could\'ve provoked a major diplomatic incident!$B$BAt least you learned important information.', 0),
(40559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This is embarrassing. Especially for me, as a Captain.', 0),
(40560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Ritual of Divination. Yes, I am able to perform it. But be wary, $R. It is extremely dangerous for the spirit, and for the caster.', 0),
(40561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah, the Arcane Resonator. I thought this technology to be lost when Archimonde crushed Dalaran. Fortunately, Kirin Tor is tougher than I expected.$B$BShall we begin?', 0),
(40562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So it was the deserters. Very well, I suspected it, to be honest. These people have no honor. We shall send our best men to deal with them. But before this, I think the Horde should also get an explanation and... an apology.$B$BAnd when it comes to this Mariner, let me consult with some of my advisors. I think I may have heard of this man before.', 0),
(40563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The deserters. I knew they were vile people, but to burn innocents alive... Light, save the souls of these poor people.$B$BSo be it. Kagoro is already around here, we should meet him at once.', 0),
(40564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'What did you learn, soldier?', 0),
(40572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Krog says you were the one to find the hoofprints. You have a keen eye, I\'m more than willing to accept your aid.', 0),
(40573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This isn\'t much $N, but we\'ll make do.$B$BSomething seems to be scribbled on this tablet, you said you found it on one of them?', 0),
(40574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Mangletooth$B$B<snorts.>$B$Bgreets you $R.', 0),
(40575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Mangletooth happy, give Mangletooth eyes!$B$B<Mangletooth snorts loudly as he munches the eyes with gluttony, a real pig in your eyes.>', 0),
(40576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This makes no sense, $N, the quilboar were a good lead but it only sent us to a dead end.', 0),
(40577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'From frog in the well to frog in the ocean it is then. It would\'ve been so easy if the quilboar had done it, but the ancestors test us still.$B$BIt is time to evaluate the evidence we have and look to the other leads perhaps.', 0),
(40578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Another dead end.$B$B<Krog ponders for a moment.>$B$BDead end. Exactly!', 0),
(40579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You again? Need something fixed, I fix it good.', 0),
(40580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'As you look around, you are able to identify some footprints. This grave was clearly tampered with.', 0),
(40581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I apologize, I was deep in thought. I know what our next action is.', 0),
(40582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I\'m afraid that the human won\'t act rationally when we tell them about the death of their comrades. They will think of us as savages.', 0),
(40703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I feel it now, severed from this dreadful link. I am at peace, and for that I thank you.', 0),
(40718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kagoro? What does he want now? I\'m not making him another of those super spyglasses again, just so you know!', 0),
(40719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Perfect bub, let\'s do some investigatin\'.', 0),
(40720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So, is that true?$B$BIt clears up one more lead for us, we should bring our evidence forward to the Alliance.', 0),
(40721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'It seems we know our next course of action.', 0),
(41114, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Recovered, at last.$B$B<Magus Hallister lets out a breath of relief.>$B$BOur secrets are returned to safe hands. You have proven yourself a valuable asset, and as a fellow mage I am certain you understand the power of the arcane in the right hands.$B$BTake this, as thanks from us here in the city.', 0),
(80352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '$N, you\'re a doll! This is great, I can\'t thank you enough.$B$BIf you get any more you know where to find me.', 0),
(80353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah yes, that\'s absolutely great bub. Just toss them right there, here\'s the pay.$B$BThere\'s always work for you here if you need it.', 0),
(80390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'What\'s this, a letter from Gazlowe?', 0),
(80403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I suppose I can use the help. There\'s not much here a $C would be interested in, anyway.', 0),
(80404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Drazzit accepts the cargo from you.>$B$BI\'m so hungry, I could eat a dragon! Thank goodness Moxie finally got some of that cargo down here. We\'ve been reduced to playing dice against the ogre for whatever he\'s managed to kill on his hunting trips!', 0),
(80405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Wow! You certainly found a lot more than I expected would be out there. I\'m not sure how much Drazzit thought we were going to find out here, but he\'s going to have to be happy with this for now.', 0);
INSERT INTO `quest_request_items` (`ID`, `EmoteOnComplete`, `EmoteOnIncomplete`, `CompletionText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40352, 0, 0, '<N\'ribbi stares at you>.', 0),
(40353, 0, 0, '<N\'ribbi stares at you>.', 0),
(40402, 0, 0, 'Tharg friend angry with Tharg.', 0),
(40403, 0, 0, 'What you want?', 0),
(40404, 0, 0, 'Big sack!', 0),
(40405, 0, 0, 'Meat?', 0),
(40406, 0, 0, 'You back already, mon?', 0),
(40407, 0, 0, 'Have you found a sigil?', 0),
(40408, 0, 0, 'Ye wrangle up them spider legs? Remember to get the extra juicy ones.', 0),
(40409, 0, 0, 'I advise you to be careful when you\'re fighting them, they tend to stick together.', 0),
(40410, 0, 0, 'Every minute that burns away is a minute less that we have.', 0),
(40411, 0, 0, 'I\'ve been waiting patiently, have you gotten it yet?', 0),
(40413, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40414, 0, 0, 'Have you slain the foul monster?', 0),
(40415, 0, 0, 'Have you gotten those reports yet?', 0),
(40416, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40417, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40418, 0, 0, 'Have you had any luck?', 0),
(40548, 0, 0, '$N, right? Thanks for coming so fast.', 0),
(40549, 0, 0, 'Back so soon? The camp is west of here.', 0),
(40550, 0, 0, 'New customer?', 0),
(40551, 0, 0, 'Got it?', 0),
(40552, 0, 0, 'Were you able to translate the tablet?', 0),
(40553, 0, 0, 'Welcome back, $N. What did you discover?', 0),
(40554, 0, 0, 'Were our scouts of any use?', 0),
(40555, 0, 0, 'This grave is big enough to fit a tauren for sure. It\'s worth investigating.', 0),
(40556, 0, 0, 'Have you found anything?', 0),
(40557, 0, 0, '$N! Nice to see you.', 0),
(40558, 0, 0, 'Back already? What did you learn?', 0),
(40559, 0, 0, 'Have you found their rooms? They should be downstairs.', 0),
(40560, 0, 0, 'I studied the Arcane Arts for decades. Yet I always craved... Something more.', 0),
(40561, 0, 0, 'Back from Dalaran already?', 0),
(40562, 0, 0, 'I heard terrible noises coming from the Mage Tower. What happened?', 0),
(40563, 0, 0, 'Did our people really betray us?', 0),
(40564, 0, 0, 'The Horde have been honest about their investigations, it makes me happy that we disclosed our own information.', 0),
(40572, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40573, 0, 0, 'Have you found anything?', 0),
(40574, 0, 0, 'Speak.', 0),
(40575, 0, 0, 'Mangletooth could <snort>. really <snort.> <snort.> REALLY enjoy some <snort.> eyes right now.', 0),
(40576, 0, 0, 'Something to say?', 0),
(40577, 0, 0, 'Quickly now.', 0),
(40578, 0, 0, 'I\'m listening.', 0),
(40579, 0, 0, 'What now?', 0),
(40580, 0, 0, 'The grave was dug out, you can see a Tauren skeleton but no shield.', 0),
(40581, 0, 0, 'Huh?', 0),
(40582, 0, 0, 'I have spoken with the Alliance representative and they have agreed to exchange information, though I fear the news we must deliver.$B$BI hope your diplomacy is better than mine. It\'s customary to speak in their tongue if you are to call the meeting, but we\'ve only learned some of their language in internment camps. Bah!$B$BNow that I think about it, you don\'t talk much do you? We\'re doomed.', 0),
(40703, 0, 0, 'I can not rest, while this evil still lurks.', 0),
(40718, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40719, 0, 0, 'You got the goods?', 0),
(40720, 0, 0, 'You got what you need?', 0),
(40721, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(41114, 0, 0, 'This is a matter most dire. Have you recovered the manuscript?', 0),
(80352, 0, 0, 'Any luck finding the oil?', 0),
(80353, 0, 0, 'Can you believe it? He went back to cutting!$B$BPlease tell me you got a few back.', 0),
(80390, 0, 0, 'Durotar Labor Union, has a nice ring to it, doesn\'t it?', 0),
(80403, 0, 0, 'How can I be sure that I can trust you?', 0),
(80404, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(80405, 0, 0, '<Moxie looks frantic with worry.>$B$BDid the cargo survive? Did you find any of it?', 0);
