(61056, 36, 0, 'The Ogres speak of a haunted sailor terrorizing the shores, but I doubt it\'s connected.', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66559'),
(5088, 134, 0, 'Hmm... Right now we are looking to bring the Deserter\'s to justice. They have a hideout located within the Quagmire, and are led by one named Sellick Voss.', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66560'),
(61056, 37, 0, 'Sellick Voss?', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66561'),
(5088, 135, 0, 'Sellick Voss was a Captain for Theramore. He is looking to bring hostility between the Alliance and Horde, it is his actions that have led to the death of many.', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66562'),
(61056, 38, 0, 'The Horde will help bring peace to Dustwallow, should we get an opportunity to find this \'Sellick Voss.\'', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66563'),
(60731, 0, 0, 'Magus Halister begins to call upon the arcane, his channeling draws forth the energy of the spiritual realm.', 16, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66619'),
(60953, 0, 0, 'Who disturbs my rest? Do I owe my service to the Alliance even in death? Let me pass to the Spirit Realm in peace.', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66582'),
(60731, 1, 0, 'Paval Reethe. In life, you failed to uphold honor. You deserted your friends, your family. Now you have a chance to redeem yourself.', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66583'),
(60953, 1, 0, 'Isn\'t it obvious? The deserters did it. Not me, though. In my last days, I did what was right. I tried to stop them. That\'s why they left me in the swamp.', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66584'),
(60731, 2, 0, 'Why? Why did they burn it?', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66585'),
(60953, 2, 0, 'Shady Rest Inn was open to everyone. Even us. We have spent many evenings there, laughing and drinking. But one time, some of our people got too drunk. They started meddling with the innkeeper. Until they said too much. Something about the Vengeful Mariner. They couldn\'t allow this to reach Theramore, so they burned the inn. No witnesses.', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66586'),
(60731, 3, 0, 'Vengeful Mariner?', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66587'),
(60953, 3, 0, 'Paval Reethe laughs openly.', 16, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66588'),
(60953, 4, 0, 'You would not understand.', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66589'),
(60953, 5, 0, 'The Spirit of Paval Reethe vanishes.', 16, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66590'),
(60731, 4, 0, 'Paval! I curse you, come back! Reethe!', 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66591'),
(60731, 5, 0, 'Magus Halister sighs.', 16, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66592'),
(60731, 6, 0, 'Well, looks like he left us for good. At least we got some answers out of him. Now, go back to Captain Garran Vimes. He will know what to do next.', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66593'),
(60729, 0, 0, 'Make sure that the Colonel gets it.', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66726'),
(60730, 0, 0, 'The last one didn\'t make it back to Theramore, be quick.', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66727'),
(60949, 0, 0, 'Oh yes, a sizable force moved here recently... Very recently. They are the Grimtotem Tauren, though. At odds with the horde, as far as I am concerned. Good. Let them fight among themselves.', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66459'),
(60950, 0, 0, 'A Tauren? Well, I haven\'t seen any in a long time here. I heard something about Grimtotem in the north? You could have greater success asking closer to the Brackenwall Village. Maybe they know of some Tauren newcomers.', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66460'),
(60951, 0, 0, 'Let me think... No, I haven\'t seen any come here recently. Brackenwall Village is a remote outpost, and they barely have anything to trade. On the other hand, I remember one tauren fellow living in Brackenwall. We fought side by side during the siege... Haven\'t seen him in ages. He probably drowned in the swamp.', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66461'),
(8139, 100, 0, 'Hey now, hush, I don\'t need everyone knowing my business. Here it is, if you ever need more, you know where to find me bub!', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66723'),
(8139, 101, 0, 'Oh, that, I was wondering if he would ever pick it up, I put a lot of time in obtaining this information. Now, go on before someone notices us.', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66724'),
(60866, 0, 0, 'Ribbit!', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66704'),
(60867, 0, 0, 'Riiiibit!', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66705'),
(60868, 0, 0, 'Riibit!', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66706'),
(60866, 1, 0, 'Ribit!', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66707'),
(60867, 1, 0, 'We are saved!', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66708'),
(23570, 100, 0, 'Now then, let us see if this ash is truly dragon made...', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66564'),
(23570, 101, 0, 'Gizzik studies the ash carefully with the scope.', 16, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66565'),
(23570, 102, 0, 'Well, it would appear I am mistaken after all, this isn\'t dragonfire at all!', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Turtle broadcast text 66566');
